      "message": "Would this increase cma allocation failure rate? IIUC current logic assumes that isolation failure is caused by a short-term pinning and that retry has a high chance of succeeding. I assume there was a compelling usecase when this assumption was true and the retry really helped. Are you sure this change would not regress such usecases?",
